  "notes": "{鉄|てつ} refers to iron as a material, and by extension, steel and iron products.\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {鉄道|てつどう}: railroad, railway\n- {地下鉄|ちかてつ}: subway\n- {鉄板|てっぱん}: iron plate, griddle; also slang for \"guaranteed\"\n- {鉄砲|てっぽう}: gun, firearm\n- {鉄橋|てっきょう}: iron bridge\n\nEXPRESSIONS:\n- {鉄|てつ}は{熱|あつ}いうちに{打|う}て: Strike while the iron is hot\n\nSIMILAR MATERIALS:\n- {銅|どう}: copper\n- {銀|ぎん}: silver\n- {金|きん}: gold\n- {鋼|はがね}: steel (refined iron)\n\nSLANG:\n{鉄板|てっぱん} also means \"guaranteed\" or \"sure thing\" in modern slang.",
